  <tr><td>Impotence resulting in non-consummation</td><td>S. 12(1)(a)</td><td>Voidable</td><td>Focus is incapacity vis-à-vis the petitioner, proved on evidence</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Incapacity to consent / mental disorder at marriage</td><td>S. 5(ii) r/w S. 12(1)(b)</td><td>Voidable</td><td>Condition must exist at the time of marriage</td></tr>
